OL,3,GNEWSATrackside fire blocks railway line
OL,4,
OL,5,FA fire next to a railway track in the
OL,6,FWest Midlands blocked the line between
OL,7,FBirmingham International and Coventry.
OL,9,FThe fire, in the Canley area, caused
OL,10,Fmajor disruption until at least 19:30
OL,11,FBST on Monday, when lines were
OL,12,Freopened, National Rail said, although
OL,13,Fthe disruption would continue.
OL,15,FPassengers travelling between Coventry
OL,16,Fand Birmingham International faced
OL,17,Fservices that were cancelled, revised
OL,18,For delayed by up to 30 minutes.
OL,20,FWest Midlands Fire Service was
OL,21,Fcontacted for comment.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
